22 15.42 11.57 15.65C10.93 15.88 10.23 16 9.5 16ZM9.5 14C10.75 14 11.81 13.56 12.69 12.69C13.56 11.81 14 10.75 14 9.5C14 8.25 13.56 7.19 12.69 6.31C11.81 5.44 10.75 5 9.5 5C8.25 5 7.19 5.44 6.31 6.31C5.44 7.19 5 8.25 5 9.5C5 10.75 5.44 11.81 6.31 12.69C7.19 13.56 8.25 14 9.5 14Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div></div></button></div><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div class="faqs__inner" data-v-b67004cf><section class="faqs__wrapper" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__content" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__inner-slices" data-v-b67004cf><div data-v-b67004cf><!--[--><section id="i-don’t-have-a-printer,-what-can-i-do?" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h1><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->I don’t have a printer, what can I do?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h1><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->No printer? No problem! With our national network of <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcelshops/print-in-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->‘Print in ParcelShop’<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> locations and brand new QR code functionality, you now have even more options when it comes to sending your parcels using Evri. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’re constantly adding Print In ParcelShop devices to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcelshops" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->our ParcelShop network<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, so keep an eye out in your local stores to begin printing your labels quickly and easily at a ParcelShop. Just book your ParcelShop drop off online, arrive at your local ParcelShop with your parcel, and scan the QR code (or enter the 6 digits) we sent you via email. You’ll receive a sticky label with either of these options, so just stick it on your parcel and hand it over to the shop assistant.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/find-a-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->find your local ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> quickly and easily with our online locator. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="faqs-right-coumn" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs-additional-help" data-v-b67004cf data-v-90f8fa03><h5 data-v-90f8fa03>Additional help</h5><!--[--><a data-v-90f8fa03></a><!--]--></div></div></section><div class="faqs-accordion__container" data-v-b67004cf data-v-538ce356><section class="faqs-accordion" data-v-538ce356><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0" data-v-538ce356 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-faq-links-0" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-faq-links-0" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="faq-links-accordion-row-0-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Account</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.4